{
 "dialogue": true,
 "duration": 56.135,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "text": "You built your own fucking AI setter with Make, right?",
   "who": "setty"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "text": "All weekend, bro. ManyChat sends the DM to Make, ChatGPT writes the reply, Make sends it back.",
   "who": "coach"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "text": "Cute. Now a lead sends three messages in a row.",
   "who": "setty"
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "text": "So it answers all three? Like a robot on espresso.",
   "who": "coach"
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "text": "And does it remember what they said?",
   "who": "setty"
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "text": "Uh, it asked her name twice.",
   "who": "coach"
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "text": "Memory doesn't wire itself, you save each lead's Conversation ID and send it back. The right questions, the booking, the follow-ups? You build those too.",
   "who": "setty"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "text": "At least it's cheap.",
   "who": "coach"
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "text": "Make credits, OpenAI tokens, and your Saturday nights in a garage.",
   "who": "setty"
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "text": "Bro, I'm not a developer. I didn't want another thing to maintain.",
   "who": "coach"
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "text": "The model isn't the setter, I am. The wait, the memory, the questions, the booking, the follow-ups, already built. Plug me into ManyChat.",
   "who": "setty"
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "text": "Okay. How do I set you up?",
   "who": "coach"
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "text": "Step one, go to bed. You smell like fucking webhooks.",
   "who": "setty"
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "text": "Comment SETTY and I'll send you everything to build your AI setter for free.",
   "who": "setty"
  }
 ],
